A Claude Code mod: hooks/hooks.json holds modules, one path relative
to the file, and no hooks object. The scan is complete, the module is
listed, and the plugin is still reported by TC-CFG-010.
-- .claude-plugin/plugin.json --
{ "name": "example", "hooks": "./hooks/hooks.json" }
-- hooks/hooks.json --
{ "modules": ["./register.tsx"] }
-- hooks/register.tsx --
export default function register() {}
